OL,13,G0855 Find It, Fix It, Flog It
OL,14,     FIn the Devon countryside, Henry
OL,15,     FCole and Simon O'Brien meet
OL,16,     Fcollectors Derek and Daphne. Henry
OL,17,     Ffinds a very rare tractor, while
OL,18,     FSimon discovers a Raleigh Shopper
OL,19,     Fbike.
