OL,6,     FMandi and Paul pride themselves on
OL,7,     Ftheir high standards at Oaklea
OL,8,     FBarns Guest House on Merseyside.
OL,9,     FBut Ian is puzzled by
OL,10,     Fplastic-covered lampshades. And
OL,11,     FMark and Natalie have a loose loo.
OL,12,G1035 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FDave and Sanchia host the second
