OL,5,G1210 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FIt's the final day of the
OL,7,     Fcompetition and the B&Bers meet
OL,8,     Ffor the last time to find out how
OL,9,     Fmuch they've been paid. After some
OL,10,     Ftit-for-tat feedback, the winner
OL,11,     Fis announced.
OL,12,G1240 Come Dine with Me
OL,13,     FBournemouth. Pharmacist Shikha
OL,14,     Fkicks off the week with a
OL,15,     Ftraditional Indian dinner. Will
OL,16,     Fher rich homemade recipes and
OL,17,     Fextravagant garden party impress
OL,18,     Fher guests? (Ep1/5)
