OL,5,G1520 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe competition begins in
OL,7,     FCarmarthenshire, at Louise and
OL,8,     FRob's health-conscious Golden
OL,9,     FGrove Retreat, where a gut-healthy
OL,10,     Fbreakfast leaves some B&Bers
OL,11,     Fyearning for a fry-up.
OL,12,G1550 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FThe B&Bers head to Rosita Guest
OL,14,     FHouse in Weston-super-Mare, where
OL,15,     FSheila and Phil hope to soar to
OL,16,     Fvictory with a visit to a
OL,17,     Fhelicopter museum. But a brekkie
OL,18,     Fdelay crash-lands their chances.
