OL,6,     FPam and Mya host the week's third
OL,7,     Fvisit, at their self-catering King
OL,8,     FSquare Apartments in Somerset,
OL,9,     Fwhere some dented cookware leaves
OL,10,     Fthe hosts bent out of shape.
OL,11,G1650 Four in a Bed
OL,12,     FThe final visit is to Anton and
OL,13,     FEmma's luxury glampsite, Hartridge
OL,14,     FSprings in Upottery, in Devon,
OL,15,     Fwhere the B&Bers find out that
OL,16,     Fit's quite hard to cook a fry-up
OL,17,     Fwithout a frying pan...
